@startuml
title Account - expiry and monetary effects (REVIEW)
[*] --> ACTIVE : MAIN created by UC01\nor configured subsidiary seed
ACTIVE --> ACTIVE : valid credit/debit committed\npreserve ledger consistency
ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : expiry timestamp reached\nJOB-01 synchronizes state
note right of ACTIVE
 MAIN has no default expiry.
 Subsidiary type / permissions / expiry explicit before seed.
 Check DB clock under account row lock before updates.
 checkedAt >= expiresAt rejects; commit may occur later.
 No fallback/pooling; no negative balance.
end note
note right of EXPIRED
 Keep balance and history.
 Timestamp rejects new effects even before state sync.
 No automatic credit/reactivation/refund policy invented.
end note
@enduml
